{"id":"fd9d450264433858","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-FS-n.md","title":"FS n理论序列","display":"df-FS-n — FS_n理论序列","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-FS-n","aliases":["91-df-FS-n","91-df-FS-sequence"],"display":"df-FS-n — FS_n理论序列","depends_on":["[[91-df-FS]]","[[91-df-capture-axiom]]","[[91-df-release-axiom]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-FS-n"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-FS-n</span><span>91-df-FS-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-FS-n — FS_n理论序列"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"25c37fe51095276d\" href=\"?note=25c37fe51095276d\" title=\"91-df-FS\">91-df-FS</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7dc6a6fb8ddfca30\" href=\"?note=7dc6a6fb8ddfca30\" title=\"91-df-capture-axiom\">91-df-capture-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"efd61e76586d57ab\" href=\"?note=efd61e76586d57ab\" title=\"91-df-release-axiom\">91-df-release-axiom</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-FS-n-—-FS_n理论序列-$\\mathrm{FS}_n$\">df-FS-n — FS_n理论序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{FS}_n\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}\">\\(\\mathrm{FS}\\)</span> (Friedman-Sheard理论, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25c37fe51095276d\" href=\"?note=25c37fe51095276d\" title=\"91-df-FS\">91-df-FS</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ht}_T(\\pi)\">\\(\\operatorname{ht}_T(\\pi)\\)</span> (证明中捕获/释放规则的最大嵌套高度)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prf}_{\\mathrm{FS}}(\\pi,\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Prf}_{\\mathrm{FS}}(\\pi,\\varphi)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 是结论为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 的 FS 证明)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}FS\\text{-}n}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FS}_n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\mid\n\\exists\\pi\\,\n(\\operatorname{Prf}_{\\mathrm{FS}}(\\pi,\\varphi)\n\\land\\operatorname{ht}_T(\\pi)\\le n)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}FS\\text{-}n}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FS}_n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\mid\n\\exists\\pi\\,\n(\\operatorname{Prf}_{\\mathrm{FS}}(\\pi,\\varphi)\n\\land\\operatorname{ht}_T(\\pi)\\le n)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{FS})\n=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{FS}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{FS})\n=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{FS}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{FS}_n\\)</span> : FS理论序列的第n层</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ht}_T(\\pi)\">\\(\\operatorname{ht}_T(\\pi)\\)</span>：真理捕获/释放在证明中的嵌套高度</li>\n</ul>\n<p>FS 的每个有限证明只使用有限深度的真理规则，因此其定理集是这些有界规则高度片段的并。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{FS}_n\\)</span> 在这里是证明片段，不应误称为逐层添加“真理归纳公理”的标准理论序列。</p>\n<p>层次结构：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{FS}_0\\)</span>：不嵌套使用捕获/释放规则的后果</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{FS}_n\\)</span>：规则嵌套高度至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的后果</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{FS})\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{FS})\\)</span>：所有有限高度片段的并</li>\n</ul>\n<p>重要性质：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>片段间包含关系由定义得到；严格性和可证一致性都需要独立证明</li>\n<li>这种有限分层解释了 FS 与所有有限次迭代真理的证明论联系</li>\n<li>整体 FS 的著名缺陷是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-不一致，而不是“需要假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致”</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-FS-n-—-FS_n理论序列-$\\mathrm{FS}_n$","text":"df-FS-n — FS_n理论序列 $\\mathrm{FS}_n$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-FS","status":"resolved","id":"25c37fe51095276d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-FS]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-capture-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"7dc6a6fb8ddfca30","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-capture-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-release-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"efd61e76586d57ab","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-release-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-FS","status":"resolved","id":"25c37fe51095276d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FS}$ (Friedman-Sheard理论, see [[91-df-FS]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FS}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FS}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ht}_T(\\pi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prf}_{\\mathrm{FS}}(\\pi,\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}FS\\text{-}n}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FS}_n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\mid\n\\exists\\pi\\,\n(\\operatorname{Prf}_{\\mathrm{FS}}(\\pi,\\varphi)\n\\land\\operatorname{ht}_T(\\pi)\\le n)\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{FS})\n=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{FS}_n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FS}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ht}_T(\\pi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FS}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FS}_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FS}_n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{FS})","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1746,"backlinks":[{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-50","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-FS-n]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-96","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-FS-n]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df